<title>NEW ZEALAND: Fernz first half profit rises 3.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Fernz first half profit rises 3.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to Nov 30</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   16.12 vs 15.59</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    7.0 vs 7.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			    384.68 vs 284.69</p>
